Line 1: I can't subtract a number from text.
    keep k1 as "a" minus 1
               ^^^^^^^^^^^

Line 2: I can't use "and" between a number and a number.
    keep k2 as 1 and 2
               ^^^^^^^
To add numbers, use "plus".

Line 3: "or" needs yes or no on both sides, but the left side is text.
    keep k3 as "a" or yes
               ^^^^^^^^^^

Line 4: "not" needs a yes/no value, but this is text.
    keep k4 as not "a"
               ^^^^^^^

Line 5: I can't compare a number with text.
